  "deviceObservationOfSamples25to29": "UNKNOWN",
  "reading": "CAM 01-04 hops draw. The sheet, the CCN geometry and the dex agree, and the rebuilt runtime draws on Toy Bonnie's CAM 03 hop. Value 2 does not reconcile the audio: Withered Chica's 8->4 and 4->2 and Withered Freddy's 7->3 have no move condition and land in their promotion loop (value 2 >= 6 at the test), and Withered Bonnie's hall stage 1 -> CAM 01 waits behind the value-1 pin before promotion, not after it; only g378's return (hall stage 2 -> CAM 03) can land after value 2 is spent. The audio negative is not evidence (register item 12): in full-06 the detector read none of samples 25-29 in the whole run, not even the hall-stage footsteps 8a7288b kept, and it recovers 0 of 60 footsteps injected on the roll phase at the capture's own channel-15 gain while recovering 16 of 60 of Mangle's sample 30 at the same gain and positions. At the capture's fitted gains the footsteps' loudest 0.4 s sits 24-31 dB below its median frame level, 14-18 dB below the quietest classes it did read (samples 7 and 30).",
  "retraction": "8a7288b's inference (the trigger is narrower than the marker box, \"most likely the hall stages only\") and the field seedLockAttempt.audibleDrawsFull06.timeAxis.footstepSounds25to29 of docs/evidence/night7-k3-frametrace-nights-20260915.json are superseded as evidence by this record. The records stay as they are; the model default stays the hall stages until a comparison adopts footstepCamMarkers."
 },
